E2 and E3 exploratory analyses for the review response: the writer-switch predictors (registered agreement against the writers' per-type accuracy, P(new correct | old correct) and a definition indicator, slope and AUROC, world and type-level bootstrap, leave-one-type-out, failure counts), T1 survival, recovery, net change, the eps grid and T1 by item class, and T3 by item class with the oracle ceiling; every key starts with explore_, no existing field changes (restaging reproduces the committed analyses exactly)

